Package: watersofcasablanca
Type: Project
Title: The Waters of Casablanca: On Political Misinformation
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Robert C.", "Luskin", role = "aut"),
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com"))
Description: Theory, identification bounds, data, and manuscript for a paper
    separating stored misinformation from knowledge, tentative belief, and
    ignorance. Includes a randomized-format illustration and reproducible
    descriptive and historical analyses.
